flowchart TD
    %% ---------- Input ----------
    User([Owner / User])
    CLI[CLI<br/>main.py]
    InGuard{{Input guardrails<br/>empty / too long}}

    User -->|plain-English request| CLI
    CLI --> InGuard
    InGuard -->|rejected| CLI

    %% ---------- Agent ----------
    subgraph AGENT["Agent  (agent/agent.py)"]
        direction TB
        Loop[Orchestrator loop<br/>max N iterations]
        LLM[[LLM: Gemini or Claude<br/>PLAN: choose tool calls<br/>system prompt keeps it on-topic]]
        Exec[Tool executor<br/>whitelisted tools only]
        Loop -->|messages + tool schemas| LLM
        LLM -->|tool_use| Exec
        Exec -->|tool_result or error| Loop
    end

    InGuard -->|accepted| Loop

    %% ---------- Core ----------
    subgraph CORE["PawPal+ core  (pawpal_system.py, unchanged)"]
        direction TB
        Draft[(Draft copy of Owner<br/>pets, tasks, constraints)]
        Sched[Scheduler<br/>generate_daily_plan<br/>detect_conflicts]
        Draft --> Sched
    end

    Exec -->|ACT: add_pet / create_task /<br/>edit_task / generate_plan| Draft
    Draft -.->|ValueError / KeyError| Exec

    %% ---------- Check ----------
    Verify{{Verifier<br/>agent/checks.py<br/>deterministic, no LLM}}
    Sched -->|plan + skipped tasks| Verify
    Verify -->|CHECK: errors found,<br/>fed back to the LLM| Loop
    Verify -->|plan is valid| Review

    %% ---------- Human in the loop ----------
    Review[/Proposed plan + explanation<br/>+ warnings/]
    Human{Human approval<br/>y / n / revise}
    Review --> Human
    Human -->|revise: feedback text| Loop
    Human -->|reject| Discard[Discard draft]
    Human -->|approve| Commit[Commit draft to<br/>real Owner data]
    Commit --> Output([Final daily plan<br/>shown to user])

    %% ---------- Logging ----------
    Log[(Structured log<br/>logs/agent.log)]
    Loop -.-> Log
    Exec -.-> Log
    Verify -.-> Log
    Human -.-> Log

    %% ---------- Reliability harness ----------
    subgraph EVAL["Reliability harness  (eval/)"]
        direction TB
        Cases[/Test cases<br/>request + expected outcome/]
        Mock[[Mock LLM<br/>scripted tool calls]]
        Runner[Eval runner<br/>pass / fail per case]
        Report[/Results table<br/>README + model_card.md/]
        Cases --> Runner
        Runner --> Report
    end

    Runner -->|runs agent with| Loop
    Mock -.->|replaces the LLM<br/>in offline runs| LLM
    Verify -.->|same checks reused| Runner

    %% ---------- Styling ----------
    classDef human fill:#fde68a,stroke:#b45309,color:#000
    classDef ai fill:#bfdbfe,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#000
    classDef guard fill:#fecaca,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#000
    classDef test fill:#bbf7d0,stroke:#15803d,color:#000
    class User,Human,Review human
    class LLM ai
    class InGuard,Verify guard
    class Cases,Mock,Runner,Report test
